'''Kirin Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was introduced in [[Version 4.2 Update|Version 4.2]] and can be unlocked by playing the Event Gacha during the [[Monster Hunter Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 208
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Kirin Cat
|name2 = Kirin Cat Kirin
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Kirin Cat Kirin''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
==='''Normal Form'''===
Very similar to [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cat]] in terms of usage. Cheap and expendable, it can be summoned en masse to take hits in place of other, more important units. This meatshield role is quite valuable, if not for the wide selection of Cats able to perform it without relevant differences in quality. Kirin Cat, however, can be used in {{4c}} stages, where there is considerably less competition. This is its only use, as the [[Resistant|resistance]] against [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemies is only effective against enemies such as [[Mooth]], as any kind of real Floating threat like [[Owlbrow]] or [[Teacher Bun Bun]] will kill Kirin Cat just as easily as any other meatshield.

==='''Evolved Form'''===
Unfortunately, like the previous form, Kirin Cat Kirin gets outclassed by [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Lion Cat]] and once it is acquired, [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Cow Cat]]. The resistance against Floating enemies is slightly more helpful in this form, but still barely makes a difference in mid and late-game, as hordes of [[Li'l Bun Bun]]s or [[Brollow]]s will take it out all the same.

