==Trivia==
*Its Normal Form appears to be wearing the helmet from the Kirin Armor, an iconic armor set from ''Monster Hunter'' that has stayed mostly unchanged since its first appearance.
*Its Evolved Form resembles a [[wikia:monsterhunter:Kirin|Kirin]] from the Monster Hunter series. In the main Monster Hunter games, Kirin is an Elder Dragon. It controls the thunder element to some extent, explaining the lightning surrounding it in [[Nyanko Daisensou|Battle Cats]].
*This is the only unit in the [[Monster Hunter Collaboration Event]] that doesn't have a unique spawn animation.
*The name of its Evolved Form (キリンネコキリン, Kirin Neko Kirin) is likely a pun on how the word (キリン, Kirin) can be translated as giraffe.

